@@ -0,0 +1,7 @@
+A new method, :meth:`falcon.App.set_error_reporter` (also available as
+:meth:`falcon.asgi.App.set_error_reporter`), was added. It allows to set a
+callback that is invoked for every exception raised while Falcon processes a
+request, including instances of :class:`~falcon.HTTPError` and
+:class:`~falcon.HTTPStatus`, as well as exceptions that are not handled by any
+error handler and propagate to the application server. This affords, for
+instance, logging all exceptions or sending them to an error tracker.
