 See also :meth:`~.falcon.App.add_error_handler` to learn more about this
 feature.
 
+In order to merely observe every exception raised while processing a request
+(for instance, to log it, or to send it to an error tracker) without changing
+the way it is handled, set an error reporter via
+:meth:`~.falcon.App.set_error_reporter` (or
+:meth:`falcon.asgi.App.set_error_reporter` for ASGI apps).
+
 .. note::
     By default, any uncaught exceptions will return an HTTP 500 response and
     log details of the exception to ``wsgi.errors``.
